{"id":"vd-b2-the-corner-cafe","level":"b2","n":5,"title":{"en":"On the Plus Side…","vi":"Về mặt tích cực…"},"summary":"Bên bàn bếp, Elena cùng bố mẹ cân nhắc ưu nhược điểm của từng phương án cứu quán cà phê — bán hợp đồng thuê, giảm giá hay làm mới quán.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b2-the-corner-cafe","level":"b2","title":{"en":"The Corner Café","vi":"Quán cà phê góc phố"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"laptop","x":800,"y":640,"scale":0.75}]},"cast":{"luis":{"name":{"en":"Luis","vi":"Luis"},"look":"dad","x":300,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#9A9A9A","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"apron","top":"#784212","topShade":"#6E3B10"}},"elena":{"name":{"en":"Elena","vi":"Elena"},"look":"woman","x":800,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"blouse","top":"#2980B9","topShade":"#2471A3"}},"rosa":{"name":{"en":"Rosa","vi":"Rosa"},"look":"mom","x":1300,"style":{"hair":"bun","hairColor":"#8A8A8A","skin":"#D9A27A","skinShade":"#C48A62","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#A93226","topShade":"#922B21"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"elena","en":"OK. Let's start with the offer from Brew and Co. to buy our lease. On the plus side, the money is very generous.","vi":"Được rồi. Mình bắt đầu với lời đề nghị mua hợp đồng thuê của Brew and Co. Về mặt tích cực, số tiền rất hào phóng.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","lɛts","stɑɹt","wɪð","ðə","ˈɔfɚ","fɹʌm","bɹu","ənd","koʊ","tu","baɪ","ˈaʊɚ","lis","ɑn","ðə","plʌs","saɪd","ðə","ˈmʌni","ɪz","ˈvɛɹi","ˈdʒɛnɚəs"],"start":0.554,"end":8.114,"gesture":"explain","prop":"laptop","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.179],[2,1.454],[3,1.654],[4,1.767],[5,1.879],[6,2.254],[7,2.466],[8,2.879],[9,3.142],[10,3.566],[11,3.667],[12,3.867],[13,4.017],[14,4.841],[15,5.042],[16,5.129],[17,5.454],[18,6.204],[19,6.317],[20,6.804],[21,7.042],[22,7.429]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"How generous?","vi":"Hào phóng cỡ nào?","ipa":["haʊ","ˈdʒɛnɚəs"],"start":8.904,"end":9.634,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,8.904],[1,9.079]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"Enough for you both to retire. The main advantage is that you'd be financially secure for life.","vi":"Đủ để bố mẹ nghỉ hưu. Lợi ích chính là bố mẹ sẽ yên ổn tài chính suốt đời.","ipa":["ɪˈnʌf","fɔɹ","ju","boʊθ","tu","ɹɪˈtaɪɹ","ðə","meɪn","ædˈvæntɪdʒ","ɪz","ðæt","jud","bi","fəˈnænʃəli","sɪˈkjʊɹ","fɔɹ","laɪf"],"start":10.424,"end":15.544,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,10.424],[1,10.714],[2,10.827],[3,10.952],[4,11.226],[5,11.339],[6,12.339],[7,12.501],[8,12.727],[9,13.389],[10,13.551],[11,13.701],[12,13.864],[13,14.014],[14,14.701],[15,15.139],[16,15.289]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"And the main drawback is that we'd lose the café.","vi":"Còn bất lợi chính là mình sẽ mất quán.","ipa":["ənd","ðə","meɪn","ˈdɹɔˌbæk","ɪz","ðæt","wid","luz","ðə","kəˈfeɪ"],"start":16.334,"end":18.784,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,16.334],[1,16.442],[2,16.542],[3,16.817],[4,17.342],[5,17.467],[6,17.604],[7,17.804],[8,18.054],[9,18.154]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"Exactly. It's worth bearing in mind that you can't undo that decision.","vi":"Chính xác. Cũng cần nhớ rằng quyết định đó không thể rút lại.","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæktli","ɪts","wɝθ","ˈbɛɹɪŋ","ɪn","maɪnd","ðæt","ju","kænt","ənˈdu","ðæt","dɪˈsɪʒən"],"start":19.574,"end":23.744,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,19.574],[1,20.604],[2,20.841],[3,21.179],[4,21.579],[5,21.666],[6,22.054],[7,22.179],[8,22.291],[9,22.604],[10,22.929],[11,23.091]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"What about cutting our prices?","vi":"Còn giảm giá thì sao?","ipa":["wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ˈkʌtɪŋ","ˈaʊɚ","ˈpɹaɪsəz"],"start":24.534,"end":25.964,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,24.534],[1,24.664],[2,24.964],[3,25.289],[4,25.439]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"The advantage is that it's quick. The problem is that our margins are already tiny. In the long run, we'd lose money.","vi":"Lợi thế là làm được ngay. Vấn đề là biên lợi nhuận của mình vốn đã rất mỏng. Về lâu dài, mình sẽ lỗ.","ipa":["ðə","ædˈvæntɪdʒ","ɪz","ðæt","ɪts","kwɪk","ðə","ˈpɹɑbləm","ɪz","ðæt","ˈaʊɚ","ˈmɑɹdʒənz","ɑɹ","ɔlˈɹɛdi","ˈtaɪni","ɪn","ðə","lɔŋ","ɹʌn","wid","luz","ˈmʌni"],"start":26.754,"end":34.314,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,26.754],[1,26.824],[2,27.399],[3,27.536],[4,27.687],[5,27.849],[6,28.624],[7,28.799],[8,29.324],[9,29.437],[10,29.586],[11,29.724],[12,30.286],[13,30.649],[14,31.074],[15,31.962],[16,32.174],[17,32.274],[18,32.586],[19,33.324],[20,33.562],[21,33.861]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"So that's out of the question.","vi":"Vậy là phương án đó loại.","ipa":["soʊ","ðæts","aʊt","ʌv","ðə","ˈkwɛstʃən"],"start":35.104,"end":36.494,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,35.104],[1,35.271],[2,35.546],[3,35.721],[4,35.796],[5,35.896]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"I'd say so. My third idea is riskier, but it has far more potential.","vi":"Con nghĩ vậy. Ý tưởng thứ ba của con mạo hiểm hơn, nhưng tiềm năng lớn hơn nhiều.","ipa":["aɪd","seɪ","soʊ","maɪ","θɝd","aɪˈdiə","ɪz","ˈɹɪskiɚ","bʌt","ɪt","hæz","fɑɹ","mɔɹ","pəˈtɛnʃəl"],"start":37.284,"end":42.304,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,37.284],[1,37.514],[2,37.714],[3,38.464],[4,38.714],[5,39.039],[6,39.477],[7,39.626],[8,40.339],[9,40.764],[10,40.839],[11,41.102],[12,41.452],[13,41.639]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Go on.","vi":"Con nói tiếp đi.","ipa":["ɡoʊ","ɑn"],"start":43.094,"end":43.614,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,43.094],[1,43.286]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"We focus on what they can't copy: your roasting, Mum's cakes and events in the evening.","vi":"Mình tập trung vào những thứ họ không sao chép được: cà phê bố tự rang, bánh của mẹ và các sự kiện buổi tối.","ipa":["wi","ˈfoʊkəs","ɑn","wʌt","ðeɪ","kænt","ˈkɑpi","jɔɹ","ˈɹoʊstɪŋ","mʌmz","keɪks","ənd","ɪˈvɛnts","ɪn","ðə","ˈivnɪŋ"],"start":44.404,"end":49.674,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,44.404],[1,44.509],[2,44.959],[3,45.122],[4,45.272],[5,45.384],[6,45.634],[7,46.472],[8,46.622],[9,47.547],[10,47.872],[11,48.309],[12,48.547],[13,48.959],[14,49.072],[15,49.147]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"That sounds exhausting. Having said that, I've always wanted to roast my own beans.","vi":"Nghe mệt đấy. Nói thì nói vậy, bố vẫn luôn muốn tự rang hạt cà phê.","ipa":["ðæt","saʊndz","ɪɡˈzɔstɪŋ","ˈhævɪŋ","sɛd","ðæt","aɪv","ˈɔlˌweɪz","ˈwɔntɪd","tu","ɹoʊst","maɪ","oʊn","binz"],"start":50.464,"end":56.094,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,50.464],[1,50.649],[2,51.011],[3,52.427],[4,52.764],[5,53.064],[6,53.839],[7,54.014],[8,54.389],[9,54.714],[10,54.802],[11,55.189],[12,55.352],[13,55.589]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"The downside is that we'd be working longer hours at our age.","vi":"Điểm trừ là ở tuổi này mà mình phải làm nhiều giờ hơn.","ipa":["ðə","ˈdaʊnˌsaɪd","ɪz","ðæt","wid","bi","ˈwɝkɪŋ","ˈlɔŋɡɚ","ˈaʊɚz","æt","ˈaʊɚ","eɪdʒ"],"start":56.884,"end":60.024,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,56.884],[1,57.001],[2,57.626],[3,57.727],[4,57.876],[5,58.039],[6,58.176],[7,58.564],[8,58.964],[9,59.339],[10,59.426],[11,59.589]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"That's true. But on the other hand, you'd be doing something you love.","vi":"Đúng vậy. Nhưng mặt khác, bố mẹ sẽ được làm điều mình yêu thích.","ipa":["ðæts","tɹu","bʌt","ɑn","ðə","ˈʌðɚ","hænd","jud","bi","ˈduɪŋ","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","ju","lʌv"],"start":60.814,"end":64.744,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,60.814],[1,61.044],[2,61.819],[3,62.132],[4,62.257],[5,62.344],[6,62.581],[7,63.357],[8,63.519],[9,63.644],[10,63.956],[11,64.306],[12,64.419]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Weighing it all up, I think I'd rather try than give up without a fight.","vi":"Cân nhắc tất cả, bố nghĩ thà thử còn hơn bỏ cuộc mà chưa chiến đấu.","ipa":["ˈweɪɪŋ","ɪt","ɔl","ʌp","aɪ","θɪŋk","aɪd","ˈɹæðɚ","tɹaɪ","ðæn","ɡɪv","ʌp","wɪˈθaʊt","ə","faɪt"],"start":65.534,"end":69.394,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,65.534],[1,65.776],[2,65.864],[3,66.077],[4,66.839],[5,66.977],[6,67.214],[7,67.401],[8,67.702],[9,67.977],[10,68.139],[11,68.364],[12,68.552],[13,68.889],[14,68.964]]},{"speaker":"rosa","en":"As long as we set a time limit. If it hasn't worked in a year, we reconsider the offer.","vi":"Miễn là mình đặt ra thời hạn. Nếu sau một năm không ổn, mình sẽ xem lại lời đề nghị.","ipa":["æz","lɔŋ","æz","wi","sɛt","ə","taɪm","ˈlɪmət","ɪf","ɪt","ˈhæzənt","wɝkt","ɪn","ə","jɪɹ","wi","ˌɹikənˈsɪdɚ","ðə","ˈɔfɚ"],"start":70.184,"end":75.794,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,70.184],[1,70.329],[2,70.591],[3,70.691],[4,70.816],[5,71.029],[6,71.091],[7,71.391],[8,72.729],[9,72.916],[10,73.004],[11,73.366],[12,73.629],[13,73.704],[14,73.741],[15,74.404],[16,74.566],[17,75.204],[18,75.329]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"That's a sensible compromise. One year, and then we review everything honestly.","vi":"Đó là một thoả hiệp hợp lý. Một năm, rồi mình đánh giá lại mọi thứ thật thẳng thắn.","ipa":["ðæts","ə","ˈsɛnsəbəl","ˈkɑmpɹəˌmaɪz","wʌn","jɪɹ","ənd","ðɛn","wi","ˌɹiˈvju","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ","ˈɑnəstli"],"start":76.584,"end":81.524,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,76.584],[1,76.764],[2,76.852],[3,77.352],[4,78.477],[5,78.776],[6,79.477],[7,79.564],[8,79.739],[9,79.901],[10,80.314],[11,80.889]]},{"speaker":"luis","en":"Agreed. Now, who wants a coffee? A proper one, not from across the road!","vi":"Đồng ý. Giờ ai muốn uống cà phê nào? Cà phê tử tế, không phải của bên kia đường!","ipa":["əˈɡɹid","naʊ","hu","wɑnts","ə","ˈkɑfi","ə","ˈpɹɑpɚ","wʌn","nɑt","fɹʌm","əˈkɹɔs","ðə","ɹoʊd"],"start":82.314,"end":88.364,"expression":"happy","react":{"rosa":"happy"},"timing":[[0,82.314],[1,83.472],[2,83.897],[3,84.047],[4,84.334],[5,84.422],[6,85.637],[7,85.799],[8,86.299],[9,86.949],[10,87.249],[11,87.399],[12,87.862],[13,87.999]]}],"words":[{"id":"generous","en":"generous","ipa":"ˈdʒɛnɚəs","vi":"hào phóng; rộng lượng; nhiều, thoải mái","level":2},{"id":"advantage","en":"advantage","ipa":"ædˈvæntɪdʒ","vi":"lợi thế; ưu điểm","level":1},{"id":"margin","en":"margin","ipa":"ˈmɑɹdʒən","vi":"lề (trang giấy); biên độ; lợi nhuận biên","level":3},{"id":"potential","en":"potential","ipa":"pəˈtɛnʃəl","vi":"tiềm năng; khả năng","level":2},{"id":"compromise","en":"compromise","ipa":"ˈkɑmpɹəˌmaɪz","vi":"sự thỏa hiệp; thỏa hiệp; làm tổn hại","level":2},{"id":"exhausting","en":"exhausting","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɔstɪŋ","vi":"mệt lử; vắt kiệt sức","level":3}],"focus":{"title":"Cân nhắc ưu nhược điểm của các phương án","pattern":"On the plus side, … · The main advantage/drawback is (that)… · It's worth bearing in mind that… · In the long run, … · Having said that, … · Weighing it all up, …","explain":"Nêu mặt lợi: \"On the plus side…\", \"The main advantage is that…\". Nêu mặt hại: \"The main drawback is…\", \"The downside is…\". Lưu ý thêm: \"It's worth bearing in mind that…\". Chuyển ý ngược lại: \"Having said that…\", \"On the other hand…\". Kết luận sau khi cân nhắc: \"Weighing it all up, I think…\".","keys":["on the plus side","the main advantage is","the main drawback is","worth bearing in mind","in the long run","having said that","weighing it all up"],"lines":[0,2,3,4,6,11,14]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b2-the-corner-cafe.mp3","v":"ef7f3acb70","duration":89.448,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}